WEBVTT

00:06:28.141 --> 00:06:30.419
and it's completely different
from chemotherapy,

00:06:30.443 --> 00:06:32.323
because it selectively aims

00:06:32.347 --> 00:06:34.884
at the blood vessels
that are feeding the cancers.

00:06:35.384 --> 00:06:39.819
We can do this because tumor blood vessels
are unlike normal, healthy vessels

00:06:39.843 --> 00:06:41.633
we see in other places of the body --

00:06:41.657 --> 00:06:44.781
they're abnormal,
they're very poorly constructed,

00:06:44.805 --> 00:06:47.059
and because of that,
they're highly vulnerable

00:06:47.083 --> 00:06:48.892
to treatments that target them.

00:06:50.666 --> 00:06:54.198
In effect, when we give cancer patients
antiangiogenic therapy --

00:06:54.222 --> 00:06:57.206
here, an experimental drug for a glioma,

00:06:57.230 --> 00:06:58.976
which is a type of brain tumor --

00:06:59.000 --> 00:07:01.782
you can see that there are
dramatic changes that occur